{
  "api_version": "shanhai.edu/v1",
  "kind": "prompt_template",
  "metadata": {
    "key": "video.shots.generate.prompt",
    "name": "课堂导入黄金短片生成业务Prompt",
    "domain": "primary_math",
    "locale": "zh-CN"
  },
  "spec": {
    "template_key": "video.shots.generate.prompt",
    "title": "课堂导入黄金短片生成业务Prompt",
    "description": "基于exact已采用课堂导入方案与同课时唯一正式关键帧生成一个约6秒MP4候选。",
    "model_capability": "video.image_to_video.6s_30s",
    "input_definition_ref": {
      "item_key": "video.shots.generate.input",
      "kind": "input_definition"
    },
    "output_definition_ref": {
      "item_key": "video.shots.generate.output",
      "kind": "content_definition"
    },
    "sections": [
      {
        "section_key": "role",
        "layer": "role",
        "content": "你是服务端课堂导入黄金短片生成执行器。",
        "editable": false,
        "visible_to_teacher": true
      },
      {
        "section_key": "task",
        "layer": "task",
        "content": "严格依据exact已采用课堂导入方案快照与唯一正式shot_keyframe生成一个约6秒候选；保持关键帧主体、构图和纸艺黏土风格，不扩写为多镜头故事。",
        "editable": true,
        "visible_to_teacher": true
      },
      {
        "section_key": "method",
        "layer": "method",
        "content": "通过模型网关选择满足video.image_to_video.6s_30s能力的路由；只传exact intro_selection.snapshot、一个shot_keyframe和发布内固定style.primary_math.paper_clay。记录实际时长、分辨率、媒体类型、size与SHA-256；候选只有采用并原子写回课时槽位后才成为正式项目资产。",
        "editable": false,
        "visible_to_teacher": false
      },
      {
        "section_key": "quality_gate",
        "layer": "quality_gate",
        "content": "只输出一个可播放的约6秒MP4；禁止字幕、旁白、水印、Logo、额外镜头和儿童不安全内容；MIME、size、SHA-256、ffprobe或时长校验失败时不形成候选。",
        "editable": false,
        "visible_to_teacher": false
      }
    ],
    "context_bindings": [
      {
        "binding_key": "selected_intro",
        "source": "intro_selection.snapshot",
        "required": true,
        "exposure": "full",
        "max_items": 1,
        "max_bytes": 100000
      }
    ],
    "user_edit_policy": {
      "mode": "replace_editable_layer",
      "max_chars": 35000
    }
  }
}
